 "notes": {
  "n-cap": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "text": "/remind in Capture. Every confirmation echoes when and how often in words (FR-5).\nRemindResolved: default time (FR-3), time already passed (FR-4), month-end rule (FR-8).\nRemindAsk: no date asks one question (FR-2); the 101st reminder is refused (FR-38).\nRemindList: /reminders (FR-25).",
   "w": 460,
   "page": "page-1",
   "fill": "blue"
  },
  "n-rec": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "text": "Records gains a Reminders tab (FR-26), grouped Needs attention / Upcoming / Done, picked 2026-09-23.\nFired-not-done and missed rows carry Done and Snooze inline (FR-19 to FR-23).\nDetail shows next fire, repeat, last fired and what happened (FR-27). Edit applies to the series (FR-28). Delete confirms and removes the series (FR-29).",
   "w": 460,
   "page": "page-2",
   "fill": "blue"
  },
  "n-not": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "text": "Bell with unread count on every topbar (FR-36) opens a slide-over panel, picked 2026-09-23 (FR-35, FR-37).\nLate and Missed markers (FR-17, FR-18). Email-cap notice (FR-39).\nPop-up: bottom-right, stays until acted on or closed, stacks (FR-13, FR-21, FR-22).",
   "w": 460,
   "page": "page-3",
   "fill": "blue"
  },
  "n-set": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "text": "Settings gains a Reminders section: default time (FR-31), two switches (FR-32, FR-33), both-off warning (FR-34).\nEmail: plain, lightly branded, text shown, link only (FR-15, epic Q4, PRD Q1).",
   "w": 460,
   "page": "page-4",
   "fill": "blue"
  },
  "n-mob": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "text": "Mobile 390x844. Bell sits beside the avatar; the panel becomes a full screen.",
   "w": 400,
   "page": "page-5",
   "fill": "blue"
  },
  "n-dark": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "text": "Same screens on 001's dark tokens (DarkRecords.dc.html), no new palette.",
   "w": 420,
   "page": "page-6",
   "fill": "blue"
  },
  "n-load": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "w": 520,
   "page": "page-7",
   "fill": "blue",
   "text": "Added 2026-09-23 at the user's request.\nSkeletons: Records, reminder detail and Settings load as grey bars in the final layout, never a spinner page.\nButton loaders: Save, Delete, pop-up Done and a Settings switch show a spinner in place and lock the form until the call returns.\nSuccess toast: dark bar, top-centre under the header, hides after 4 seconds, with a View link. Shown on reminder created and reminder updated. Top-centre keeps it clear of reminder pop-ups (bottom-right) and the command bar."
  },
  "n-states": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": -380,
   "w": 560,
   "page": "page-8",
   "fill": "blue",
   "text": "Added 2026-09-23: every state and error drawn, not only described.\nReminders tab: empty, failed to load, search with no match, session ended, offline.\nDetail and edit: not found, missing name, no weekday, time already passed, save failed, deleted while editing.\nDelete failed. Pop-up: action failed, offline. Panel: action failed. Settings: save failed, switch flips back.\n/remind: model unavailable, input kept. Cap reached is on page 1 (RemindAsk).\nEvery failure says what did not change, and keeps what the user typed."
  }
 },
